WEBVTT

00:01:29.961 --> 00:01:32.296
because they're simply not safe.

00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:38.427
400,000, that's 45 women every hour,

00:01:38.469 --> 00:01:40.221
face varying degrees of violence,

00:01:40.263 --> 00:01:42.974
ranging from domestic violence
to rape in India.

00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:47.603
A 13-year-old girl and her mother
were gang-raped on a highway

00:01:47.603 --> 00:01:50.481
just 45 minutes
from where my parents live.

00:01:51.732 --> 00:01:52.984
When I heard this,

00:01:54.777 --> 00:01:57.363
I just recalled the same incident
that happened to me.

00:01:58.489 --> 00:01:59.907
I was devastated.